rofessional assassin, retainer, common-sense girl.\n\nBrown: cafe maid boss, coffee girl.\n\nOpal: music composer and theatre girl. Reckless type.\n\nAnything is fine! \n\nThank you very much for your time!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tg-HEjnr8RJ8h-nrW-Um0YfQxp22FEg7", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@satomoriumi/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3889079, "client_id": 1810528, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a28201910df8b6f4c04bdc1af33f0811", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a28201910df8b6f4c04bdc1af33f0811, https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f8556de3a0ee0c1605ea34e85b8b532 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b43849f9d777d9540f9c81cb47425d2c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba49ba87ad447bb2e5e2b004ff33768d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba49ba87ad447bb2e5e2b004ff33768d, https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccomp